OL,3,CFrench electropop musician Kavinsky
OL,4,Cdies, aged 50
OL,6,FTributes have been paid to French
OL,7,Felectro-pop DJ Kavinsky who has died
OL,8,Faged 50.
OL,10,FThe musician, whose real name was
OL,11,FVincent Belorgey, was best known for
OL,12,Fhis 2010 song Nightcall, which was
OL,13,Fused in the soundtrack of action drama
OL,14,Ffilm Drive, starring Ryan Gosling.
OL,16,FHe was reportedly found dead at his
OL,17,Fhome in Paris on Tuesday. Authorities
OL,18,Fare investigating the cause of his
OL,19,Fdeath.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/6
