PN,31602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785394079
OL,3,CFrench electropop musician Kavinsky
OL,4,Cdies, aged 50
OL,6,FCanadian artist The Weeknd, whose real
OL,7,Fname is Abel Tesfaye, paid tributes to
OL,8,Fthe French DJ.
OL,10,FOn X he posted a picture of Kavinsky
OL,11,Fand said it was "heartbreaking to hear
OL,12,Fthe news".
OL,14,FHe added that Kavinsky is "an
OL,15,Finspiration to so many, including
OL,16,Fmyself.
OL,18,F"I will continue to honour your name
OL,19,Fand your music. Rest easy, Kavinsky."
