PN,31603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785394079
OL,3,CFrench electropop musician Kavinsky
OL,4,Cdies, aged 50
OL,6,FPosting on Facebook, French president
OL,7,FEmmanuel Macron described Kavinsky as
OL,8,Fa "source of French pride forever".
OL,10,FCatherine Pegard, minister of culture
OL,11,Fof France, said on X that : "France
OL,12,Fhas lost one of its most unique
OL,13,Fvoices".
OL,15,FShe recalled how the "whole world was
OL,16,Fmoved" by Kavinsky's performance of
OL,17,Fhis hit track Nightcall at the 2024
OL,18,FParis Olympics closing ceremony,
OL,19,Falongside Belgian singer Angele.
OL,26,@sD@]OUuD@GO]wD@VOUxD@FO]
