OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785394079
OL,3,CFrench electropop musician Kavinsky
OL,4,Cdies, aged 50
OL,6,FThe performance caused streams of the
OL,7,Fsong to soar, and according to music
OL,8,Fidentification app Shazam, the track
OL,9,Fbroke the record for the most searches
OL,10,Fin a single day.
OL,12,F"Both danceable and nostalgic, his
OL,13,Fmusic will continue to transcend
OL,14,Fgenerations and borders," Ms Pegard
OL,15,Fadded.
