OL,3,CFrench electropop musician Kavinsky
OL,4,Cdies, aged 50
OL,6,FKavinsky was born in Seine-Saint-
OL,7,FDenis, north of Paris. He was
OL,8,Fpreviously an actor before launching
OL,9,Fhis music career.
OL,11,FHe is recognised for his red-eyed
OL,12,Fzombie DJ alter ego, and aside from
OL,13,Fthe synth-wave hit Nightcall, he is
OL,14,Falso known for songs such as Odd Look
OL,15,Fand Roadgame.
OL,17,FKavinsky said his electropop sound was
OL,18,Finspired by 1980s film soundtracks,
OL,19,Fand in 2007 he supported fellow French
OL,20,Felectronic DJ duo Daft Punk on tour.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/6
