PN,31606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785394079
OL,3,CFrench electropop musician Kavinsky
OL,4,Cdies, aged 50
OL,6,FThe Mayor of Paris, Emmanuel Gregoire
OL,7,Fpaid his respects and expressed his
OL,8,F"deep sadness" over Kavinsky's death.
OL,10,FOn X he posted: "A child of Paris, he
OL,11,Fcarried the colours of the French
OL,12,Felectronic scene high across the
OL,13,Fworld, establishing a unique musical
OL,14,Funiverse imbued with both nostalgia
OL,15,Fand modernity.
OL,17,F"In this moment of mourning, my
OL,18,Fthoughts go to his family, his loved
OL,19,Fones, and all those who found
OL,20,Fthemselves in his music."
OL,26,@rD@QOUyD@AOU|D@YO]
